strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p>① 本项目在报名阶段不分研究方向，录取阶段按照研究方向录取；</p><p>② MF优才营仅能入营一次，未入营可继续申请MF其他批次或安泰其他项目；</p><p>③ MF优才营1&amp;2入营后获得A档的同学，不能申请安泰直博以外的其他项目；</p><p>④ MF优才营1&amp;2入营后未获得A档的同学，可以申请安泰其他项目；若两个项目都获B档，以首先转为A档的项目为优先，其他项目的B档资格自动取消；</p><p>⑤ MF优才营3和安泰其他项目夏令营仅能申请一个。</p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>4</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>考核方式</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p>“</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong> 笔 试 </strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p>逻辑思维（2小时）</p></section><section><section><section><section><p>“</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong> 面 试 </strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p>单面，重点考察考生的综合素质、专业素质、英语水平、创新能力、沟通能力、职业素养等</p></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>5</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>招生流程</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/RxC5bjkicqicvP3JnR2wbDkpECpW39pVx0TlztSZkLXf4roJUhEGOQffe4Bg8LUWpUTdKpzgAyzuvIzKZYCmhaiaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p>交大安泰MF优才营招生流程图</p></section><p><br/></p><section><p>每一批次中表现优异的学生将获得“优秀营员”资格，具体结果以正